    // Part 1 — dam olish kunlari uchun mashina ijarasi
    private static ListeningPart ListenT7P1() => new(1,
        "You will hear a woman phoning a car hire company to hire a car for the weekend.",
        [
            M("Paul", "Good afternoon, Kingsway Car Hire, Paul speaking. How can I help?"),
            F("Sophie", "Hi. I'd like to hire a car for this coming weekend, if you've got anything available."),
            M("Paul", "Let's have a look. Can I start with your name, please?"),
            F("Sophie", "Yes, it's Sophie Brennan."),
            M("Paul", "Is that B, R, E, N, A, N?"),
            F("Sophie", "Nearly. There's a double N in the middle. So it's B, R, E, N, N, A, N."),
            M("Paul", "Got it, thanks. And have you held a full driving licence for more than three years? We need that for the insurance."),
            F("Sophie", "Oh yes. I passed my test when I was eighteen, and I'm twenty-five now, so that's seven years."),
            M("Paul", "Fine. What kind of car were you thinking of?"),
            F("Sophie", "Something small, really. It's just me and my cousin, and we won't have much luggage. The main thing is that it's an automatic. I've driven automatics for years, and I'd rather not go back to changing gear on steep country roads."),
            M("Paul", "No problem, we've got a small automatic available. Can I ask where you're heading? Some of our cars can't be taken abroad."),
            F("Sophie", "We're only going up to the Lake District. A friend of ours is getting married up there, so it's a wedding, but we're going to make a whole weekend of it."),
            M("Paul", "Lovely. Now, when would you like to pick it up?"),
            F("Sophie", "On Friday afternoon, if possible. Would that be from your office in the city centre?"),
            M("Paul", "Actually, our city centre office is closed at the moment while it's being refurbished. For the next couple of months, all our cars go out from the office next to the bus station. Do you know it?"),
            F("Sophie", "Yes, I think so. That's fine, it's actually easier for me to get to."),
            M("Paul", "Good. And when will you bring the car back?"),
            F("Sophie", "On Sunday. We probably won't be back until about eight in the evening."),
            M("Paul", "Ah. I'm afraid the office closes at six on Sundays. If you return the car after that, it's treated as an extra day, and you'd have to pay for Monday as well."),
            F("Sophie", "Right. Then we'll make sure we're back by six."),
            M("Paul", "Now, the price. Our standard rate for a small automatic is 45 pounds a day. But we've got a weekend offer on at the moment, so it comes down to 39 pounds a day, as long as you pick up on Friday and return on Sunday."),
            F("Sophie", "That's good. Does that include insurance?"),
            M("Paul", "The basic insurance, yes. You mentioned your cousin. Will she be driving as well?"),
            F("Sophie", "Yes, we'll probably share the driving, because it's quite a long way. Is that extra?"),
            M("Paul", "It's eight pounds a day to add a second driver. She'll need to bring her licence too, of course."),
            F("Sophie", "OK, let's add my cousin, then. Her name's Jess Brennan, same surname as me."),
            M("Paul", "Done. Would you like any extras? A satnav is five pounds a day."),
            F("Sophie", "No, thanks. I'll just use the maps on my phone. But I'd need somewhere safe to put the phone while I'm driving."),
            M("Paul", "Every car can have a phone holder fitted, and there's no charge for that."),
            F("Sophie", "Perfect, I'll have a phone holder, then."),
            M("Paul", "Now, fuel. The car will have a full tank when you collect it, and we ask you to return it with a full tank too. Otherwise we charge you for the fuel, and our prices are quite a bit higher than a normal petrol station."),
            F("Sophie", "Full to full. That's fine."),
            M("Paul", "Last thing. When you collect the car, please bring your driving licence and something that shows your home address. A recent utility bill or a bank statement is fine."),
            F("Sophie", "I don't get paper bills any more. Would a bank statement that I print from my online banking be OK?"),
            M("Paul", "Yes, that's fine, as long as it's from the last three months."),
